[l_english.trade_request_wargoal]
“Free” Trade

[l_english.trade_request_wargoal_desc]
Request the target country to open up trade or establish our branch in their country.

[l_english.trade_request_wargoal_short_desc]
This war goal will make puppet and topple government cheaper to pick at the peace conference.

